{
  "_about": "Parts a plasmid can carry, for the search by meaning. 're' is a case-insensitive pattern run on the feature names read from the attached sequence files, on the words of a question, and on the text of an entry. 'label' / 'query' replace 're' for that one use. Edit freely: it is read at every search, nothing needs re-indexing.",
